cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use MATERIA in your work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "MATERIA: crystal and magnetic structure refinement in the browser"
abstract: >-
  Rietveld, single-crystal F², magnetic-structure and PDF/mPDF refinement on one
  TypeScript engine, checked against GSAS-II, FullProf, SHELXL and PDFfit2, with an
  in-app AI Copilot and an MCP server. Runs in the browser; data stay on the user's machine.
authors:
  - family-names: "Yang"
    given-names: "Tsung-Han"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0003-0186-302X"
version: "0.5.1"
date-released: "2026-11-20"
license: AGPL-3.0-only
repository-code: "https://github.com/drthyang/materia-platform"
url: "https://drthyang.github.io/materia-platform/"
keywords: [Rietveld refinement, magnetic structure, pair distribution function, crystallography, neutron diffraction, X-ray diffraction]
